          "comment": "# Comfy Image to Video\n\nIt shows how to go from a simple prompt to a Wes Anderson-style image using a cinematic image model, then enhance it with Nano Banana to improve textures and details, and finally turn it into a video using the current best video model, Kling 3.0. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/templates_ohneis_i2v.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
